MODULE: PartitionScopedRefusalTreeWideVerdict
TARGET: PartitionScopedRefusal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a plain writer wrongly gates on a busy sibling
PERTURBS: GateCheck
BOUNDS: AcuteOnly = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.writer = Response(GateValue), !.source = "None"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: restore tree-wide coupling from issue 3348.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.writer = Response(treeVerdict[1]), !.source = "None"]
--- END
